      "en": "David inquired of God, saying, “Shall I go up against the Philistines? Will you deliver them into my hand?” The LORD said to him, “Go up; for I will deliver them into your hand.”",
      "ko": "다윗이 하나님께 물어 가로되 내가 블레셋 사람을 치러 올라가리이까 주께서 저희를 내 손에 붙이시겠나이까 여호와께서 이르시되 올라가라 내가 저희를 네 손에 붙이리라 하신지라",
      "source_text_hash": "12d92bc7f39828004f9c3d96996972dc437bc1e7a8b193db421bc86d325b126b",
      "translation_text_hash": "d4e2d50dca4d468c191f5dbad8ebad109c224f603535878fa58885c5a9eba48c",
